    <string name="d_sv_details_body">Search model: potion-base-8M by Minish Lab, MIT licence, %1$s. Downloaded once from Hugging Face and checked against a fixed checksum. Works best in English.\n\nText in pictures: read on this phone. Google may collect anonymous statistics about how ML Kit is used.\n\nAI suggestions: only items saved after you turn this on are sent. Items you saved before are only sent if you ask, under Saved items.\n\nYour saved items, notes and titles are never changed without you. Indexing runs in the background and pauses while the battery is low.</string>
